'''''Star Wars''''' is a [[canon]] ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[Star Wars comic books|comic book]] series initially written by [[Jason Aaron]] with art by [[John Cassaday]]. The [[Marvel Comics]] series, which began publishing on [[January 14]], [[2015]] as a reboot of the original [[Star Wars (1977)|Star Wars series]], features the characters [[Luke Skywalker]], [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]], [[Han Solo]], [[Chewbacca]], [[C-3PO]], and [[R2-D2]] going on adventures set between the events of [[Star Wars: Episode IV A New Hope|''Star Wars'': Episode IV ''A New Hope'']] and [[Star Wars: Episode V The Empire Strikes Back|''Star Wars'': Episode V ''The Empire Strikes Back'']]. The series concluded with [[Star Wars (2015) 75|issue 75]], which was released on [[November 20]], [[2019]], and was relaunched with [[Star Wars (2020)|another series]] of comics on [[January 1]], [[2020]].<ref name="Announcement">{{SW|url=news/marvels-star-wars-comic-relaunch|text=Marvel's ''Star Wars'' Comic To Relaunch with Writer Charles Soule}}</ref>
